    "about": {
      "items": [
        {
          "items": [
            "Top Reasons to Book Sea Thyme - <br><br>- 3 blocks from the amazing beaches of 30A! <br>- Incredibly large private pool. (Option to heat also available.) <br>- Walking distance to Seaside, Watercolor, and Old Seagrove. Only 0.8 miles from Seaside!<br>- Covered seating outside around the pool.<br>- Gas grill & outdoor dining space. <br><br>Bedroom 1: King Bed & Ensuite Bathroom (Newly remodeled!)<br>Bedroom 2: Full over Queen Bunk (Sleeps 4)<br><br>Welcome to \"Sea Thyme,\" your very own slice of paradise located in the most desired area of Scenic 30A. The beaches along 30A are renowned for their powdery white sand and clear turquoise waters. Managed by the experts at Emerald Coast Vacation Rentals, this enchanting vacation rental is your ticket to a seaside holiday full of fun and sun in Santa Rosa Beach, Florida.<br><br>Located in the quaint Old Seagrove community, \"Sea Thyme\" is more than just a place—it's an escape for beach lovers! With its blend of charming old Florida and picturesque beaches, your stay here is sure to be the beach getaway you deserve.<br><br>Step through the front door and be greeted by a beautifully updated home. The spacious living space opens up to an outdoor oasis with space to lounge in the sun or enjoy a meal al fresco. Inside you will find two bedrooms one with a king bed and another with built in bunks. The bunks are custom made with a queen size on the bottom and full on top. A modern kitchen featuring updated appliances, washer/dryer, and a living room with a plush couch perfect for relaxing after a day of soaking in the sun. <br><br>But the fun of \"Sea Thyme\" goes beyond its cozy walls. With Seaside, Watercolor, Alys Beach, and Grayton as your playground, you can start your day with a scenic bike ride, shop at the local boutiques, or enjoy some of the best seafood & dining in Florida.<br><br>If you're up for an adventure, there's no shortage of things to do nearby. Rent a boat and visit Crab Island, bike the trails of the national parks, or kayak the amazing dune lakes. Disconnect from your everyday life and enjoy all of the natural beauty right outside your front door. <br><br>Foodies rejoice, 30A is a gastronomic paradise! From seafood feasts to international delicacies, there's something to satiate every palate. Some of our favorites include Mimmo's, Stinky's Fish Camp, Shunk Gulley Oyster Bar & The Wine Bar. <br><br>As part of Emerald Coast Vacation Rentals, \"Sea Thyme\" promises an unforgettable beach holiday. Our team, armed with local knowledge and dedication to your satisfaction, is always ready to ensure your stay is smooth sailing.<br><br>With Emerald Coast Vacation Rentals, we make ordinary vacation rentals extraordinary. Book \"Sea Thyme\" today and let the fun begin!<br><br>FAQ:<br>Parking: The driveway can fit 2 vehicles. <br>Pets: Pets not allowed at this vacation rental.<br>Pool Heat: Pool heat is available during the colder months for an additional fee. The warmest the pool heater can be set to is 84 degrees.<br>Cooling: Due to the extreme heat, the AC cannot drop below 70. Lowering the temperature anymore will cause the AC to freeze over. <br>Guest Entry: Entry is keyless and accessible 24/7. A unique code will be sent prior to your arrival that will allow you access into the home during your stay.",
            "Our prices include all fees. No hidden fees."
          ],
