    "description": [
      "Located near the beach, this vacation home is in Seagrove Beach, a neighborhood in Santa Rosa Beach. The area's natural beauty can be seen at Grayton Beach State Park and Seaside Beach. Sundog Books and Eden Gardens State Park are also worth visiting. Looking to get your feet wet? Snorkeling, surfing/body boarding and swimming adventures can be found near the property."
