        "text": "House and over-all experience were excellent. Home was in great condition and our family loved having a private covered pool ourselves. Location was extremely convenient as well with the beach and Seaside within easy walking distance. Check-in and out process was easy. Bikes and beach chairs were waiting for us when we got there.",
