            "id": "cdc40aaa-af5c-422a-8b14-bcd9e5058789",
            "locale": "en_us",
            "response": "Angela, thank you so much for your kind words! We’re so happy to hear you and your family enjoyed your time at Sea Thyme. The pool really is such a peaceful spot, and we love that you got to relax there after beach days. Glad the location worked out perfectly for your teens too! We’d love to welcome you back anytime for another getaway.",
            "user": "VrboOwner"
          }
        ],
        "text": "We enjoyed our stay at Sea Thyme. The house was clean and conveniently located to Sea Side and the beach, which was important to us with 2 teenagers we knew would want to hangout with friends in the area. My favorite part of the house was the swimming pool. It is surrounded by a wooded lot that makes it feel so peaceful. I loved reading by the pool while listening to bird song, and the cool water was refreshing after a hot day at the beach.",
